; Project the original tmpfs_domain macro's new audio-private transition onto
; Linux-owned anonymous tmpfs/memfd. The TE adapter supplies original macro
; permissions and type; existing file_type filesystem association is retained.
; No generic Linux tmpfs write, executable, Binder, device or app rights added.
(typetransition hal_audio_default linux.tmpfs_t file hal_audio_default_tmpfs)
